    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "对于采用比例加积分控制 (D_c = k_P + k_I/s) 且被控对象为 G = A/(τs+1) 的速度控制示例，回路传递函数为 G D_cl(s) = A(k_P s + k_I) / (s(τs+1))。该系统为 1 型系统，速度常数为 K_v = A k_I。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "For a speed control example with proportional plus integral control (D_c = k_P + k_I/s) and plant G = A/(τs+1), the loop transfer function is G D_cl(s) = A(k_P s + k_I) / (s(τs+1)). The system is Type 1 and the velocity constant is K_v = A k_I.",
